Source: ydyun-usbctl
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: YDYUN Linux Adapter <root@localhost>
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), python3, pkg-config, libspice-client-gtk-3.0-dev
Rules-Requires-Root: binary-targets

Package: ydyun-usbctl
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, usbip, libspice-client-gtk-3.0-5
Description: least-privilege YDYUN USB/IP guest controller
 User-space controller for attaching approved remote USB/IP devices to
 Debian's vhci-hcd. USB storage and HID devices use the Linux kernel's
 native drivers. Vendor security, monitoring, QoE and telemetry agents
 from the Windows bundle are intentionally not included.
